OL,3,GNEWSANew 24-hour shop approved despite
OL,4,Aviolence fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new 24-hour convenience store in the
OL,7,F"busiest area of Liverpool" has been
OL,8,Fgiven the go-ahead to open amid fears
OL,9,Fit will make life for other shop
OL,10,Fworkers "less safe".
OL,12,FThe Spar chain is planning to open the
OL,13,Funit in a former Holland & Barrett
OL,14,Foutlet on Whitechapel in Liverpool.
OL,16,FSpar Central is to take over the vacant
OL,17,Fpremises in the autumn after receiving
OL,18,Fthe green light from Liverpool City
OL,19,FCouncil's licensing and gambling
OL,20,Fsub-committee.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
