OL,3,GNEWSANew 24-hour shop approved despite
OL,4,Aviolence fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision came after a shopkeeper
OL,7,Fsubmitted as evidence images of his
OL,8,Fstaff being attacked in a bid to
OL,9,Fconvince city licensing bosses not to
OL,10,Fapprove an alcohol licence for another
OL,11,Fstore.
